  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: CALL \"EXTPROG\" fixture gives meta {call_type, evidence_type, file} with no callee_name. Sites moved to cobol.py 403->408 (PERFORM) and 434->439 (CALL); META_BEARING_KWARGS (meta_write_discipline.py:78) is unchanged. A re-sweep also hits kotlin.py 1872->1877, but that site merges existing meta, so cobol is the only offender. MECHANISM: wholesale .meta replacement after a make_unresolved_edge construction drops callee_name; the rule-3 lint only recognises META_BEARING_KWARGS constructor kwargs."  # b3ac
